      <MissionDesc>In collaboration with the school's Band and Orchestra Directors, the purpose of the Del Norte High School Music Boosters (the "Boosters") is (i) to develop and inspire student interest in all of the instrumental music programs at Del Norte High School including Band, Orchestra and Color Guard (collectively, the "Program"), (ii) to provide moral and financial support to the Program, (iii) to promote and maintain an enthusiastic and active interest in the Program thereby developing and sustaining a top performing instrumental music program at all levels, (iv) to encourage parents, teachers, administrators and the public to support the Program, and (v) to operate in full compliance with the Internal Revenue Service 501(c)(3) guidelines.</MissionDesc>
